track 9 of Unbreakable Momentum
Instrumental-only synth-rock / funk-rock track at 88 BPM built around a confident, intentional forward-driving groove, Drums are tight and decisive—driving kick, clean snare, and focused hi-hats with subtle syncopation that reinforces motion without urgency, Bass carries a clear, repeating motif that feels chosen and unwavering, anchoring the rail with purpose, Guitars and synths sharpen in tone and articulation, looping short, affirmative phrases that reinforce direction rather than tension, Harmonic movement remains minimal and unresolved but stable, conveying commitment instead of buildup, Background textures are sparse and controlled, No vocals, no drops, no chaos—the track moves forward because it chooses to, and never looks back
